# Grizzly Bears (2/2) attacks Narset, Parter of Veils rather than the
# player -- ai controls no creature, so this is the two-eligible-target case
# (the player, or their planeswalker) that makes DeclareCombatAttackers ask
# ChooseAttackTarget at all (CR 508.1d). Combat damage removes loyalty
# counters instead of reducing life (CR 120.3c).
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
queue attacktarget 2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
